---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
permalink: /
---
{% set sheetOrManual = fetched.events | preferItems(manual.events) %}
{% set events = [sheetOrManual, fetched.gcalEvents.items] | upcomingEvents %}
{% set next = events[0] %}

<section class="hero-card">
  <p class="hero-eyebrow">{{ site.school }} · {{ site.schoolYear }}</p>
  <h1>Help every Sidewinder thrive.</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">
    We're the parents, teachers, and students behind the field trips, spirit days,
    book fairs, and teacher appreciation at Saguaro Creek K-8. Join us — it's
    {{ site.membershipPrice }} a year, and it all goes back to our kids.
  </p>
  <div class="button-row">
    <a class="btn btn-big" href="{{ site.store }}">Join the PTSA — {{ site.membershipPrice }}/year</a>
    <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/volunteer/">Volunteer with us</a>
  </div>
  {% if next %}
  <a class="hero-next" href="/calendar/">
    <span class="event-date" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="event-mon">{{ next.date | mon }}</span>
      <span class="event-day">{{ next.date | dayNum }}{% if next.endDate %}–{{ next.endDate | dayNum }}{% endif %}</span>
    </span>
    <span class="hero-next-body">
      <span class="hero-next-label">Next up</span>
      <strong>{{ next.title }}</strong>
      <span class="event-meta">{{ next.date | readableDate }}{% if next.time %} · {{ next.time }}{% endif %}</span>
    </span>
    <span class="hero-next-more">All events →</span>
  </a>
  {% endif %}
</section>

{% if site.membershipCount > 0 %}
<section class="section section-cta">
  <div class="goal">
    <p class="goal-line"><strong>{{ site.membershipCount }} families strong</strong> — help us reach {{ site.membershipGoal }} this year!</p>
    <div class="goal-bar" role="img" aria-label="{{ site.membershipCount }} of {{ site.membershipGoal }} members">
      <div class="goal-fill" style="width: {{ (100 * site.membershipCount / site.membershipGoal) | round }}%"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="section">
  <h2>What your {{ site.membershipPrice }} does</h2>
  <p>
    Membership dues and fundraisers pay for real things Sidewinders see all year:
    classroom and teacher support, family events like restaurant nights and the
    book fair, spirit gear, and staff appreciation. Our motto —
    “{{ site.motto }}” — is how we work: families, staff, and students pulling
    in the same direction.
  </p>
  <ul class="feature-list">
    <li><strong>Be in the know.</strong> Hear what's happening at school first, and how to support your child.</li>
    <li><strong>Build relationships.</strong> Meet other families at meetings and events.</li>
    <li><strong>Speak up.</strong> Have a real voice in decisions at your child's school.</li>
    <li><strong>Hone your skills.</strong> Put your talents to work for kids and teachers.</li>
  </ul>
  {# Photo slot: when we have event photos (with consent), add a small gallery
     here — real Sidewinder faces beat any graphic. #}
  <div class="button-row">
    <a class="btn" href="{{ site.store }}">Join the PTSA — {{ site.membershipPrice }}/year</a>
  </div>
  <p class="fine-print">Dues are {{ site.membershipPrice }} per person, plus processing fees. Joining takes about two minutes on Givebacks.</p>
</section>

<section class="section section-cta">
  <h2>No time for meetings? Perfect — volunteer your way.</h2>
  <p>
    Cut paper from your couch, run a game booth for an hour, or help plan the next
    big event. Most of our volunteer work happens behind the scenes, on your
    schedule. 💚
  </p>
  <div class="button-row">
    <a class="btn" href="/volunteer/">Raise your hand — it takes 2 minutes</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Thank you to our sponsors!</h2>
  <p>
    Local businesses make our programs possible — and our families notice who
    shows up for their school.
  </p>
  <div class="button-row">
    <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/community-sponsors/">Meet our sponsors</a>
    <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/sponsor-us/">Become a sponsor</a>
  </div>
  <p class="fine-print">{{ site.name }} is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit — sponsorships and donations are tax-deductible.</p>
</section>
